Error [E0762]: `deadline` needs an Int epoch-millis instant, got String (text)
  --> tests/ui/context_deadline_wrong_type.jet:3:14
    |
  3 |     @Context(deadline: "soon") {
    |              ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: the `deadline` field carries an absolute time budget in milliseconds
 Fix: pass an Int, e.g. `time.now() + 200`
